 "юниты": [
  {
   "text": "A",
   "startMs": 12445,
   "endMs": 15480,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "new evening in a coffee shop",
   "startMs": 13200,
   "endMs": 19705,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "thick fog dissolves the houses",
   "startMs": 15480,
   "endMs": 19705,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "I wander through neighborhoods where memories",
   "startMs": 20320,
   "endMs": 26200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "drive me crazy",
   "startMs": 23080,
   "endMs": 26200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Where warm spring",
   "startMs": 26400,
   "endMs": 32095,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "covers the soul with winter",
   "startMs": 29040,
   "endMs": 33320,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Where life flew like an arrow past dates, past",
   "startMs": 33320,
   "endMs": 38645,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "us",
   "startMs": 36760,
   "endMs": 39160,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "We hoarded papers, forgetting why we",
   "startMs": 39160,
   "endMs": 45520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "live",
   "startMs": 43080,
   "endMs": 45520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "And it always seemed that [the music] was",
   "startMs": 45720,
   "endMs": 52200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "still playing ahead",
   "startMs": 47240,
   "endMs": 52200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Only time on loan",
   "startMs": 52600,
   "endMs": 58520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "gives nothing",
   "startMs": 54560,
   "endMs": 58520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "And suddenly cold ice falls on the heart",
   "startMs": 59240,
   "endMs": 64440,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "We learn to appreciate when we lose",
   "startMs": 64440,
   "endMs": 72200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "when someone's light goes out behind the door",
   "startMs": 68960,
   "endMs": 74670,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "We wave after the departed trains, trying",
   "startMs": 72200,
   "endMs": 75240,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "to beg the past for an answer",
   "startMs": 75240,
   "endMs": 81920,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "We learn to love when it has cooled down",
   "startMs": 78320,
   "endMs": 85000,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "when there is ash in our palms, and not steel. Oh",
   "startMs": 81920,
   "endMs": 86360,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "if only I could know in advance",
   "startMs": 85000,
   "endMs": 90000,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "how this transparent sadness would ache in my soul",
   "startMs": 86360,
   "endMs": 91840,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "He",
   "startMs": 90000,
   "endMs": 94320,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "didn’t say, he didn’t hug, he didn’t have time",
   "startMs": 91840,
   "endMs": 97840,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "This is an eternal motive. He",
   "startMs": 94320,
   "endMs": 101120,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "saved everything for later and didn’t open his heart to others",
   "startMs": 97840,
   "endMs": 103545,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "We fight with the shadow",
   "startMs": 104000,
   "endMs": 106520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "we",
   "startMs": 106111,
   "endMs": 110480,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "burn in empty trifles",
   "startMs": 106520,
   "endMs": 113316,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "And you can’t see how the frost",
   "startMs": 110480,
   "endMs": 113880,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "settles",
   "startMs": 113316,
   "endMs": 116960,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "on our shoulders",
   "startMs": 113880,
   "endMs": 119211,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Only happiness is not in the glitter of a shop window",
   "startMs": 116960,
   "endMs": 121800,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "not in a wad of bills, but in the quiet",
   "startMs": 119211,
   "endMs": 125040,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "truth of loved ones, in their warmth amidst storms. But",
   "startMs": 121800,
   "endMs": 126880,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "we only value what can",
   "startMs": 125040,
   "endMs": 129920,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "no longer be returned",
   "startMs": 126880,
   "endMs": 132600,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Continuing on our long",
   "startMs": 129920,
   "endMs": 135760,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "and often meaningless journey",
   "startMs": 132600,
   "endMs": 140280,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "we learn to appreciate when is lost",
   "startMs": 135760,
   "endMs": 143480,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "when someone's light goes out behind the door",
